* Official layout reference (Claude, 2026-11-12, VCO r6; docs/layout/tasks.md T3).  Device values from
* analog/pll/vco/spice/vco_ring4_r6.spice, vco_delay_r6.spice, cap_bank_5b.spice.  Resistors are fixed-width high_po
* (3 terminals, body vss).
* Half unit of the 5-bit bank.  MIM: the FIRST pin is the top plate (capm) and must be 'node'; the bottom plate (met3)
* goes to the switch drain 'plate' (LVS does not check this: read it in *_lvs.spice).  Switch: two fingers of 0.75 um
* sharing the drain.
.subckt pll_vco_cap_unit_r6_pdk node en vss
Xcap node plate sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w=2.0 l=2.0
Xsw plate en vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=1.5 l=0.15 nf=2
.ends pll_vco_cap_unit_r6_pdk
